## Scope

VNeID, email, SMS, storage, API keys, webhooks, connectivity checks and integration logs.

## Acceptance criteria

- Secrets are masked and never committed or rendered in UI.
- Each adapter exposes health, last success, last failure and retry policy.
- Webhook delivery is idempotent and auditable.
- Mock adapter can be replaced without changing feature components.

